{"id":"d_main_23_02_s","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch23","label":"Chapter 23 · Prison"},"label":"Who Are Responsible?: A","stage":"23-6 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_23_01_e","next":"d_main_23_02_e","speakers":{"ingrid":"Ingrid","mustang":"Mustang","syuen":"Syuen"},"icons":{"ingrid":"si_c900_00_s","mustang":"si_c902_00_s","syuen":"si_c901_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_1","text":"Missilis headquarter conference room.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"MissilisOffice","bgArt":"missilisoffice","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_fairytalesend_if","movie":null,"shown":["ingrid","syuen","mustang"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_2","text":"So, what you're telling me is that","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_3","text":"the gaping hole in the Ark's roof, which caused Raptures to come pouring in, is Exotic's doing?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_4","text":"Right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_5","text":"I took a look at the data that Enikk shared.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_6","text":"It's not enough to give credence to our suspicions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_7","text":"However, even though there is room for suspicion, we still do not have conclusive evidence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_8","text":"Les activités of Exotic have been spread across such a wide area.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_9","text":"Crow just purchased a bomb meant for excavation, and enregistréed it on the Dark Net.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_10","text":"Viper is only speaking to her acquaintances, as usual.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_11","text":"Jackal just gnawed through the rivets keeping the elevator tied down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_12","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mustang","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_13","text":"However, there is a very simple way we can déterminer whether our suspicions are correct.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_14","text":"Right. It will be easily solved with a brain scan.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_15","text":"By using a deep brain scan, we can determine the intent behind their actions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_16","text":"That will give us what we need to find out what role Exotic played in all this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_17","text":"Why bother with all that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_18","text":"The evidence that we've got is already pretty damning.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_19","text":"If you ask me, this case has already been solved. Why bother going through all these convoluted and unnecessary steps?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_20","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_20","text":"Syuen starts to poke at her phone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_21","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_21","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_22","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_22","text":"*Grab*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_23","text":"Hey, what the...?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_stormbreakers","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_24","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_24","text":"I grab Syuen's wrist.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_25","text":"Have you lost your mind? Let me go!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_26","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_26","text":"On the phone screen, I can see that the Exotic self-detonation app has been opened.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_27","text":"Why are you opening that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_28","text":"What do you think, genius? I'm going to blow their heads off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_29","text":"That's what they get for blasting a hole in the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_30","text":"If you press that button, you'll be sorry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_31","text":"Good grief, you're always on the Nikkes' side, aren't you? Even when they've gone rogue.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_32","text":"I assume you were planning on covering this up as well?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_33","text":"... What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_34","text":"Exotic belongs to Missilis.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_35","text":"If it comes to light that Nikkes from Missilis were involved in terrorist activities,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_36","text":"the company's stock would take a nose dive, as would its beloved reputation which you care so much about.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_37","text":"Have you completely lost your marbles since you came back from the surface?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_38","text":"Listen, I know you're not exactly my biggest fan, but do you really think I'd do something as despicable as trying to sweep this under the rug?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_39","text":"Yes, I do. And yes, you would.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_40","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_41","text":"Let go of me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_42","text":"Don't press it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_43","text":"We need to be absolutely certain of who the culprits are.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_44","text":"Ugh! What is wrong with you people?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_45","text":"Everyone has been evacuated, and the Raptures that have breached the Ark are all going to be taken care of.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_46","text":"Even a Heretic managed to find its way in, but apparently, a Pilgrim came and subdued it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_47","text":"This is an open-and-shut case! Why are you all insisting on making this more difficult than it has to be?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_48","text":"If someone commits a crime, they should be punished. It's time that Exotic faces the music.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_49","text":"I don't think this is as cut and dried as you make it out to be.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_50","text":"The blame for this incident is being pinned on E.H.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_51","text":"E.H. is the leader of Heavenly Ascension.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_23_02_s_52","text":"And Heavenly Ascension is a terrorist organization in the Outer Rim.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_23_02_s_53","type